  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A demonic meteor streaks from you to a point you choose within range and erupts. Each creature in a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on that point makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 2d8 Fire damage plus 2d8 Necrotic damage on a failure or half as much on a success.</p><p>For the duration, demonic spirits like fel imps dart around the Sphere. A creature that enters the Sphere or ends its turn there makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 1d8 Fire damage plus 1d8 Necrotic damage on a failure or half as much on a success. A creature can be affected by this spell only once per turn.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
